sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State EVConnectedPreSession

    CS->>CSMS: AuthorizeRequest (idToken.type = eMAID, idToken.type = <Configured ISO15118 idToken>, iso15118CertificateHashData = <hashData's from MO certificate chain>)
    CSMS-->>CS: AuthorizeResponse (allowedEnergyTransfer = [<csms_allowedEnergyTransferModes>])
    Note over CSMS: Validation: AuthorizeResponse<br>idTokenInfo.status must be Accepted

    CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (eventType = Started, transactionInfo.transactionId = <transactionId>, idToken.additionalInfo.additionalIdToken = <Configured EVCCID>, idToken.additionalInfo.additionalInfo.type = EVCCID)
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse
    Note over CSMS: Validation: TransactionEventResponse<br>idTokenInfo.status must be Accepted

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post condition: N/a
